            "created_at": 1680580271,
            "pk": "17930749310562178",
            "text": "🎬 В среду, 5 апреля в 17:00 приглашаем вас на инфосессию на нашем телеграмм-канале astana_hub!\n⠀\n🎙 Мы расскажем о том, как пройти бесплатную пре-акселерацию от Astana Hub и Draper University и на 5 недель отправиться в сердце Кремниевой долины по программе Hero Training.\n⠀\n📣 Задайте вопросы кураторам программы в онлайне.\n⠀\n🎮 Скорее загляните в сторис, мы подготовили для вас интересный QUIZ.\n⠀\n〰️〰️〰️〰️〰️〰️〰️〰️\n⠀\n🎬 We would like to invite you to an information session that will take place on April 5th at 5:00 PM. The session will be held on Astana Hub's Telegram channel astana_hub.\n⠀\n🎙 During the session, we will provide participants with valuable insights on how to obtain a free pre-acceleration program from Astana Hub and Draper University. Furthermore, we will be discussing how you can participate in the Hero Training program, which is a five-week immersive experience in the heart of Silicon Valley.\n⠀\n📣 We encourage you to join the private chat for program participants to engage with the program curators and ask any questions that you may have. Additionally, please remember to confirm your participation.\n⠀\nSee you at the information session."
